      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1552540303,
          "type": null,
          "body": "FYI: This MR fixed the below warnings reported by tools/check_typed_item_calls.py --all-checks.\n\n```\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_reserved filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.reserved mask 0x0C with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN  indicates max of 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_reserved filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.reserved mask 0x0C with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 4  indicates should be 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_p filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.p mask 0x02 with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN  indicates max of 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_p filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.p mask 0x02 with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 4  indicates should be 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_i filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.i mask 0x01 with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN  indicates max of 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_hdr_obj_flags_i filter= pcep.obj.hdr.flags.i mask 0x01 with len 2 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 4  indicates should be 1\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_lsp_update_capability filter= pcep.stateful-pce-capability.lsp-update mask 0x0001 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_include_db_version filter= pcep.sync-capability.include-db-version mask 0x0002 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_lsp_instantiation_capability filter= pcep.stateful-pce-capability.lsp-instantiation mask 0x0004 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_triggered_resync filter= pcep.stateful-pce-capability.triggered-resync mask 0x0008 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_delta_lsp_sync_capability filter= pcep.stateful-pce-capability.delta-lsp-sync mask 0x0010 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\nWarning: epan/dissectors/packet-pcep.c hf_pcep_triggered_initial_sync filter= pcep.stateful-pce-capability.triggered-initial-sync mask 0x0020 with len 4 but type FT_BOOLEAN | 32  indicates should be 8\n```",
